      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THATS ARCHIES GIRL (3) has been excellent in two runs this prep over shorter trips. Lengthened nicely under the big weight last start to get up for third over 1200m at this track. Suited by the small field and over an extra 150m today looks very tough to hold out. Consistent mare HEY DAISY (2) made a similar late charge to THATS ARCHIES GIRL when they clashed here a fortnight ago and was edged out of third spot by that mare. Been up for a while so doubt she can improve, and she is new to this trip, but that form still puts her deep among the chances. CELTIC SIN (1) has been freshened up since a tidy second over 1400m at Newcastle a month ago. Looks good enough to compete in a race like this. TRAFALGAR SQUARE (4) has been a consistent performer since joining the Munce camp this prep. Down in class and very fit so a win will not surprise. SMART CRY (6) has struggled in her two runs in Sydney this prep but can turn things around.",
